&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diligent created the modern governance movement. Our world-changing idea is to empower leaders with the technology, insights and connections they need to drive greater impact and accountability – to lead with purpose. Our employees are passionate, smart, and creative people who not only want to help build the software company of the future, but who want to make the world a more sustainable, equitable and better place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in New York, Diligent has offices in Washington D.C.,&amp;nbsp; London, Galway, Budapest, Vancouver, Bengaluru, Munich, Singapore and Sydney.  &amp;nbsp;To foster strong collaboration and connection, this role will follow a hybrid work model. If you are within a commuting distance to one of our Diligent office locations, you will be expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;work onsite at least 50% of the time.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe that in-person engagement helps drive innovation, teamwork, and a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
